  "notes": "The full import closure of the 12 EMMO 1.0.3 modules CHAMEO imports, enumerated and verified 2026-08-24 in docs/research/emmo-closure-1.0.3.tsv: 25 modules, 14,800 triples, all warning-free under riot --validate, CC-BY-4.0 throughout. Pinned raw at the 1.0.3 tag; commit b85a0803c47819fc4b53b9c9fd6c61878f714c5b is the immutable form, verified byte-identical. The closure has 12 root modules and no file that imports them all, so the main file is the first row of the tsv by convention and every module is an explicit merge input for reasoning. Each module's owl:versionIRI is the versioned w3id IRI recorded as its importIri; ontology IRIs are version-less. The squashed full-EMMO artifact on GitHub Pages was rejected: 4.2 times this closure, one version IRI for twelve aliases, and a CI-regenerated path that is not a pin. This is a subset of EMMO, not full EMMO: chemistry and units are absent."
